{"id":"n62751-1-10","stage":4,"title":"샘물 · 泉水","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62751-1-10-1","ko":"오늘 낮에 등산을 하던 중에 너무 더워서 흐르는 샘물에 얼굴을 씻었어.","zh":"今天白天去爬山的时候太热了，我就用流动的泉水洗了把脸。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"낮에","meaning":"白天，白日，日间","explanation":"낮：白天，白日，日间；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"낮","audio":"/audio/cde379a91768ef6117a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64497","senseId":"1","lemma":"낮","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"낮에","audio":"/audio/7fdfc5c3ffa68235ca32.mp3"}},{"text":"등산을","meaning":"登山","explanation":"등산：登山；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"등산","audio":"/audio/ae5010e03333d4ba63ff.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40293","senseId":"2","lemma":"등산","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"등산을","audio":"/audio/abe767043d9f11e77824.mp3"}},{"text":"하던","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하던","audio":"/audio/a8618be94e7c3334e6a5.mp3"}},{"text":"중에","meaning":"的时候","explanation":"중：的时候；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"중","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79404","senseId":"2","lemma":"중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"중에","audio":"/audio/f0d257645978930f07ec.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太。","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"더워서","meaning":"热，暑","explanation":"덥다：热，暑；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"덥다","audio":"/audio/038a0682ef015c0a8e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44484","senseId":"1","lemma":"덥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더워서","audio":"/audio/4fc1026c1fcc769f3258.mp3"}},{"text":"흐르는","meaning":"流，流淌","explanation":"흐르다：流，流淌；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"흐르다","audio":"/audio/91dc8d3e5e85cc29b8fa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29757","senseId":"1","lemma":"흐르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"흐르는","audio":"/audio/6dd48371bd68738e54c5.mp3"}},{"text":"샘물에","meaning":"泉水","explanation":"샘물：泉水；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"샘물","audio":"/audio/79f0ddd509a2e5d0cd33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62751","senseId":"1","lemma":"샘물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"샘물에","audio":"/audio/59c50c54fe2bc16dd8e2.mp3"}},{"text":"얼굴을","meaning":"脸，面孔，脸部","explanation":"얼굴：脸，面孔，脸部；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"얼굴","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17183","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼굴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼굴을","audio":"/audio/0cce198792a151b686e8.mp3"}},{"text":"씻었어.","meaning":"洗，刷","explanation":"씻다：洗，刷；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"씻다","audio":"/audio/1fc19ed194af13383940.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17191","senseId":"1","lemma":"씻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"씻었어","audio":"/audio/db7c1a21d2ca2343e8de.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"cde379a91768ef61","term":"낮","zh":"白天，白日，日间","a