9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"시원했겠다.","meaning":"凉爽，凉快","explanation":"시원하다：凉爽，凉快；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"시원하다","audio":"/audio/a1a23b7fbec5dd69c7b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71281","senseId":"1","lemma":"시원하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시원했겠다","audio":"/audio/6dd2fe7330c3dd3e8817.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61174","definition":"没有虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"a1a23b7fbec5dd69","term":"시원하다","zh":"凉爽，凉快","audio":"/audio/a1a23b7fbec5dd69c7b5.mp3","entryId":"71281","definition":"不冷不热，适当清凉。","pronunciation":["시원하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c89bf8ea854e0f45ee79.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.745,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62751","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":133,"sequenceScore":2.5717,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["一定很凉快吧。","姐姐，你怎么脸色不好？发生什么了？","今天白天去爬山的时候太热了，我就用流动的泉水洗了把脸。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["一定很凉快吧。","今天白天去爬山的时候太热了，我就用流动的泉水洗了把脸。","姐姐，你怎么脸色不好？发生什么了？"],"answer":0}]}
